{title: Sharabi}
{artist: Soham Naik Rahul Jain}
{key: Cm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Cm] Main Ud Chala,        [G#] Kho Chala Hun
[D#] Is Nashe me [A#] Yahan,        [Cm] Meri Dhadkane Bhi
[G#] Befikar Hain,        [D#] Is Nashe Me [A#] Yahan
[Cm] Mere Saare Lafz,        [G#] Ladkhadaye
[D#] Is me kya hai [A#] khata,        [Cm] Saare Gham bhula ke
[G#] Ji raha hoon,        [D#] Duniya ka kya [A#] pata
[Cm] Main Hua Sharabi,        [G#] Usme Kaisi Kharabi
[D#] Main Hua Sharabi,        [A#] Usme Kaisi Kharabi
[Cm] Ye Sama Hai [A#] Nasheela,        Ye [G#] Raat bhi hai [A#] jawaan
[Cm] Ye kaisa asar hai jo chad [A#] raha,        Na [G#] kisiko khabar hai hum hai [A#] kahan
[Cm] Main Ud Chala,        [G#] Kho Chala Hun...
